WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.776
QuotePlate connects your kitchen, purchasing decisions and
suppliers.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.420
Start with a menu photo, typed dishes, or a website you can
import.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:14.580
Review the extracted text, ingredient quantities, and units, then
approve the menu.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.600
Your team stays in control.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.340
Find nearby food businesses inside QuotePlate.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.060
Choose your area, category and distance.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.880
These are real public map listings with contact details when
available.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.220
Coverage varies.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:37.040
Check products and delivery capability before adding a supplier.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.980
Create one request with quantities, delivery timing, and a reply
deadline.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.740
Invite trusted suppliers or review new applications.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.720
Suppliers send their prices through a private link without
creating an account.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:01.120
Compare quantities, taxes, freight and delivery terms together.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.560
Choose one supplier or split the purchase by item.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.300
Save your reason and the accepted decision.

00:01:10.519 --> 00:01:13.620
Check received and rejected quantities against the purchase.

00:01:14.628 --> 00:01:17.472
Record billed rates, missing items, and the credit claimed.

00:01:18.322 --> 00:01:20.376
Track credit received and settlement references.

00:01:21.265 --> 00:01:25.789
Supplier performance uses this delivery evidence, including
outstanding balances.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:30.380
Give each supplier a separate private workspace link.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:35.480
They see their own orders, confirm quantities, and agree or
dispute a delivery

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:37.080
record with a document reference.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.960
If the restaurant corrects the record, earlier confirmation
becomes outdated.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:51.740
Plan the next service using portions, usable stock, and expected
yield.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:56.680
Here, 10 kilos needed and 4 already usable leave 6 kilos.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:01.380
At 80% yield, that becomes a 7.5 kilo purchase.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.600
Choose the missing ingredients you want a supplier to prepare
for.

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:11.000
Share only those estimated quantities.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.440
Recipes, portions, and stock stay private.

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:17.980
Estimates are not orders, and your team can withdraw them.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.843
Suppliers can confirm wholesale terms, service

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:26.487
PIN codes and delivery lead times.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.215
Reuse matching past prices, then

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.230
confirm today’s quantities and terms.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.479
Track billed cost per accepted

00:02:35.479 --> 00:02:37.758
unit, incomplete deliveries and outstanding credits.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:41.820
QuotePlate. Every quote, accountable.
